    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Number of recalculations of emitter importance (distance) per frame.
        Higher values = more responsive updates but higher CPU cost per frame. Typical:
        1-3. Anything > 1 has a noticable impact on CPU usage.'
